        <p>I saw her post about Metallica and couldn't help but reach out on her TikTok messages, we connected ever since...</p>
        <div class="tiktok-wrap">
          <blockquote class="tiktok-embed" cite="https://www.tiktok.com/@ab1gail1_/photo/7658135835895663886" data-video-id="7658135835895663886" style="max-width: 322px;min-width: 280px;">
