        <p>We reached our one month, and it's been the best month of our lives! We hope to continue this journey together.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">what makes her, her 💕</div>
    <h2>A few traits</h2>
    <div class="traits">
      <div class="trait">
        <h3>Your beautiful smile 💗</h3>
        <p>Your smile can brighten even my worst days, and I love being the reason it appears.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trait">
        <h3>Your kind heart 🩵</h3>
        <p>You care so deeply about the people you love, and your kindness makes everyone around you feel special.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trait">
        <h3>Your sense of humor 💗</h3>
        <p>You always know how to make me laugh, and I love that we can be completely silly together.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trait">
        <h3>Your passion 🩵</h3>
        <p>I love seeing how excited you get about the things you enjoy. Your passion makes you even more beautiful.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">things I'd otherwise forget to say 💌</div>
    <h2>A few notes</h2>
    <div class="note">
      <button class="note-head" aria-expanded="false">
        <span>We're literally twins 💗</span><span class="mark">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="note-body"><p>Since I first met you, I noticed something, we are almost completely alike: we played MDickie games growing up, we watched SpongeBob SquarePants, and we have the same sense of humor. 😎😎</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="note">
      <button class="note-head" aria-expanded="false">
        <span>You're drop-dead gorgeous 🩵</span><span class="mark">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="note-body"><p>You're are SOOOO gorgeous, I'm genuinely speechless when I look at you.😍</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="note">
      <button class="note-head" aria-expanded="false">
        <span>I love your personality 💗</span><span class="mark">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="note-body"><p>You have the most beautiful smile and the kindest heart. I love how you light up any room you walk into. 🥰</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
